# Forge System (Tier-up Synthesis)

User clicks 🔨 forge panel → sidebar Lua removes 3 entries from cv_*Details + cv_*list, appends `[FORGE_REQUEST:<cat>|<oldTier>→<newTier>|<consumed names>]` to user msg.

## AI handling (when FORGE_REQUEST present)

1. Narrate (1~2 paragraphs): the 3 consumed items fusing into one stronger result. Mention the 3 names in prose.
2. Emit ONE new SYSTEM tag matching `<cat>`:
   - `skill`    → `[SYSTEM|GACHA: Skill Learned - <English> (<한글>) | <effect with [SYSTEM|ATTACK:+N] etc> | ⭐:<newTier>]`
   - `relic`    → `[SYSTEM|GACHA: Relic Acquired - <English> (<한글>) | <effect> | ⭐:<newTier>]`
   - `facility` → `[SYSTEM|GACHA: Facility Built - <English> (<한글>) | <effect> | ⭐:<newTier>]`
3. New name: free creative (evolved/fused form of the 3 consumed). Effect strength: match `newTier` range in "Stat System" entry. LUCK allowed only if newTier ≥ 4.

## DO NOT
- Do NOT emit `[SYSTEM|ITEM_USE]` or any removal tag - Lua already removed the 3 entries.
- Do NOT narrate the 3 entries as "still owned after fusion".
